  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "08. Command Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "08.03",
    "summary": "The active player makes 1 **Battle-shock roll** for each of their units that is:\n\n- already **Battle-shocked**, or\n- at **half-strength** or less\n\nA unit that was Battle-shocked when the step began stops being Battle-shocked if its roll here succeeds.\n\nUnless a rule says otherwise, each unit makes at most 1 roll in this step: a unit that must roll earlier in the step for another reason skips the roll for its Battle-shock or strength.",
